			"notes": "* Added support for rendering entities that do not extend EntityLivingBase\n* Added particle builder classes to remove the need to define particle jsons\n* Rewrote molang parsing\n* Added more molang queries involving movement\n* Exposed head rotation to molang\n* Thaumcraft taint now overlays over RiftLibrary entities\n* Changed bone binding on armor\n* Fixed server crash\n* Many more changes (honestly i need to log these changes down soon...)"
		},
