			"notes": "Why 2.0.0? There's a lot to unpack. I mean it. Due to this, its incompatible with anything that requires RiftLibrary 1.0.0.\n\n* Moved to Cleanroom modloader. RiftLibrary is now 100% cleanroom dependent\n* Multithreaded molang\n* Removed need for using tile entities to render blocks\n* Changed rendering for... literally everything lol\n* Added Bedrock's particle system, which can now be attached to animated models\n* Added custom bounding boxes for entities\n* Added a far superior capability system\n* Added a custom tile entity abstraction\n* Added a ray system meant for things like breath attacks"
		},
