			"notes": "Welcome, welcome, to the first ever release of RiftLibrary! Note that being the first release, there's still lot's more things to improve upon and fix, but this will be serviceable for now!\n\n# Additions\n* Projectile Model support!\n* Dynamic Hitboxes!\n* Dynamic Rider Positions!\n* Animation blending!\n* GUI API!\n* Configurable mob family system!\n* Packet API!\n\nMost of this is documented in the work in progress [wiki](https://github.com/Rift-Modding-Group/RiftLibrary/wiki). In addition, this library mod will receive many more features and improvements, so stay tuned!"
